#EXTM3U
# QA fixture: group handling. Purpose and expected values: docs/QA.md, "Fixture catalogue".
# Lines starting with "# " are comments the parser must ignore.
#  - group-title "A;B;C": display group is the FIRST segment, the whole string
#    stays searchable (ARCHITECTURE.md R5, QA-ASSETS.md product call)
#  - #EXTGRP persists until the next #EXTGRP (ARCH decision 11); group-title wins
#  - an empty #EXTGRP: clears the persisting group
#  - no group at all -> synthetic "Ungrouped"
#  - provider punctuation ("UK | SPORTS") survives verbatim; padding is trimmed
#EXTINF:-1 tvg-id="multi.test" group-title="Animation;Kids;Religious",Multi Group Channel
http://stream.example.test/multi.m3u8
#EXTINF:-1 tvg-id="pipe.test" group-title="UK | SPORTS",Pipe Group Channel
http://stream.example.test/pipe.m3u8
#EXTGRP:Sports
#EXTINF:-1 tvg-id="grp1.test",EXTGRP One
http://stream.example.test/grp1.m3u8
#EXTINF:-1 tvg-id="grp2.test",EXTGRP Two Still Sports
http://stream.example.test/grp2.m3u8
#EXTINF:-1 tvg-id="grp3.test" group-title="Movies",Title Beats EXTGRP
http://stream.example.test/grp3.m3u8
#EXTGRP:News
#EXTINF:-1 tvg-id="grp4.test",EXTGRP Switched To News
http://stream.example.test/grp4.m3u8
